{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/613100/extras/e27a23266e9c17a03538f8c431029fc2.poster.avif?t=1775632015\" width=610 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/613100/extras/e27a23266e9c17a03538f8c431029fc2.webm?t=1775632015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've got to earn it around here before you purchase your first property. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No worries though! Luckily, there's plenty of work at your fingertips! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take job offers from nearby residents - clean up, paint walls, install heaters, showers, and air conditioners, or even furnish their whole property! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the grateful clients pay you for your solid work, it's time to get your own house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/613100/extras/7b4dc107190d4ae439861971307c2ec4.poster.avif?t=1775632015\" width=610 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/613100/extras/7b4dc107190d4ae439861971307c2ec4.webm?t=1775632015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your hammer! It's time to take a bit of a rude approach and knock some walls down! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get rid of broken glass shards, litter, and leftover pieces of furniture, to prepare the place for a complete makeover! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you to either meet every single requirement of specific buyers or make yourself a cozy office to grow your business in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/613100/extras/0d1dda3366a0f19c2cea12b2dcfcc489.poster.avif?t=1775632015\" width=610 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/613100/extras/0d1dda3366a0f19c2cea12b2dcfcc489.webm?t=1775632015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortunately, you're not alone. The set of your trustiest tools is here with ya! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of your paint roller, window cleaner, plaster tool, mop, hammer, and of course, the mighty tablet, no renovation will scare you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using those tools also gives you experience, which can be used to upgrade them and polish your skills, making your work even more pleasant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/613100/extras/7fa36aea00aca646366c890f3839bee3.poster.avif?t=1775632015\" width=610 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/613100/extras/7fa36aea00aca646366c890f3839bee3.webm?t=1775632015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regardless if you plan to create the house of your dreams, help the residents with their renovations or feel the need to smack some walls - </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >House Flipper is here for You! So just sit comfortably, let go off your usual daily routine, and delve into the world of House Flipper... into your world!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"fc908dbf2d2c80f85b30a7b27277d73aaa22cd10.jpg","localized_name":"Family man","name":"Family man","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/613100/fc908dbf2d2c80f85b30a7b27277d73aaa22cd10.jpg"},{"icon":"60e825d9744772da70bd43708372f43b4fc38b21.jpg","localized_name":"Geek","name":"Geek","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/613100/60e825d9744772da70bd43708372f43b4fc38b21.jpg"},{"icon":"bd80157159cfc2fb2665c423160d1c636d879600.jpg","localized_name":"Worth every penny","name":"Worth every penny","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/613100/bd80157159cfc2fb2665c423160d1c636d879600.jpg"},{"icon":"cd98c903e0f4ebe8ff555fe2562e2af138fa27ff.jpg","localized_name":"I'm a Belieber","name":"I'm a Belieber","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/613100/cd98c903e0f4ebe8ff555fe2562e2af138fa27ff.jpg"},{"icon":"94c957ab3548befade6b83aca255c3e3eea7d04f.jpg","localized_name":"Wall Street Shark","name":"Wall Street Shark","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/613100/94c957ab3548befade6b83aca255c3e3eea7d04f.jpg"},{"icon":"ca8c030e9d4e29bfea647182c10d5f0699034614.jpg","localized_name":"Mr. Mystery","name":"Mr. Mystery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/613100/ca8c030e9d4e29bfea647182c10d5f0699034614.jpg"},{"icon":"89d0599fd331bc9cd39cc325791243b16277ff01.jpg","localized_name":"Just enough","name":"Just enough","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/613100/89d0599fd331bc9cd39cc325791243b16277ff01.jpg"},{"icon":"f0f14f875d820c9b21936ff7a7e222a8d1165c49.jpg","localized_name":"The Tactical Prepper","name":"The Tactical Prepper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/613100/f0f14f875d820c9b21936ff7a7e222a8d1165c49.jpg"},